[{"id":8168058,"body":"1. 请确保手机在进行开发测试时已连网。\r\n2. 可参考华为开发者联盟以下网址FAQ中的“接口调用时返回 Scope unauthorized 错误信息”进行排查处理。\r\nhttps://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-Guides/faq-0000001050818031#section59621722810\r\n3.如仍有问题，请参考FAQ排查指导中的在线提单，华为开发者联盟在1-2个工作日内回复您的问题","user":{"id":8008356,"login":"mikemei","name":"Mike-mei","avatar_url":"https://foruda.gitee.com/avatar/1677107381402315753/8008356_mikemei_1599009887.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei","html_url":"https://gitee.com/mikemei","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/mikemei/received_events","type":"User"},"source":null,"target":{"issue":{"id":7900922,"title":"获取不到绑定的设备","number":"I4PCE2"},"pull_request":null},"created_at":"2022-01-05T14:52:30+08:00","updated_at":"2022-01-05T14:52:30+08:00"},{"id":10812637,"body":"后来搞定了，怎么搞定的忘记了 :smile: ","user":{"id":5729509,"login":"qhs1573","name":"qhs1573","avatar_url":"https://gitee.com/assets/no_portrait.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs1573","html_url":"https://gitee.com/qhs1573","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs1573/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs1573/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs1573/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs1573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/qhs15